{"staged_at":1779547890264,"surface_form":"Muhammad b. Musa b. al-Mutawakkil (rh) narrated to us. He said: `Ali b. Ibrahim b. Hashim narrated to us from Muhammad b. `Isa b. `Ubayd from Yunus b. `Abd al-Rahman from Dawud b. Farqad from Ibn Shabrama. He said: I never mentioned a hadith that I heard from Ja`far b. Muhammad (as) except that my heart would break for him. I heard him say: My father narrated to me from my grandfather from the Messenger of Allah (s). Ibn Shabrama said: By Allah, he would not lie upon his father, and his father would not lie upon his grandfather, and his grandfather would not lie upon the Messenger of Allah.","normalized_form":"Muhammad b. Musa b. al-Mutawakkil (rh) narrated to us. He said: `Ali b. Ibrahim b. Hashim narrated to us from Muhammad b. `Isa b. `Ubayd from Yunus b. `Abd al-Rahman from Dawud b. Farqad from Ibn Shabrama. He said: I never mentioned a hadith that I heard from Ja`far b. Muhammad (as) except that my heart would break for him. I heard him say: My father narrated to me from my grandfather from the Messenger of Allah (s). Ibn Shabrama said: By Allah, he would not lie upon his father, and his father would not lie upon his grandfather, and his grandfather would not lie upon the Messenger of Allah.","source_row_id":"87320","tradition":"Imami","position":0,"candidates":[{"scholar_indx":143,"name":"Muhammad bin Abu Hudhayfah ibn 'Utbah ( محمد بن أبي حذيفة بن عتبة ( رضي الله عنه","grade":"Comp.(RA)","death_date_hijri":null,"score":0.72,"features":{"exact_match":false,"blocked_match":true,"tradition_bias":false,"death_date_hijri":null}},{"scholar_indx":167,"name":"Muhammad Ibn Maslama ( محمد بن مسلمة بن سلمة ( رضي الله عنه","grade":"Comp.(RA) [1st Generation]","death_date_hijri":46,"score":0.72,"features":{"exact_match":false,"blocked_match":true,"tradition_bias":false,"death_date_hijri":46}},{"scholar_indx":168,"name":"Muhammad ibn Abi Bakr ( محمد بن أبي بكر الصديق ( رضي الله عنه","grade":"Comp.(RA) [1st Generation]","death_date