{"staged_at":1779548113700,"surface_form":"Sulayman b. Ahmad al-Lakhmi narrated to me in what he wrote to me. He said: Abu Muhammad `Abdullah b. Rumahis b. Muhammad b. Khalid b. Habib b. Qays b. `Amr b. Ghaziya b. Jashm b. Bakr b. Huwazin narrated to us in Rimada al-Qaysiyin (or Rimada al-Filastin), the exalted Rimada (?). He mentioned that there was a man who was one hundred and twenty years old. He said: Ziyad b. Tariq al-Jashmi narrated to us, and he was ninety years old. He said: My grandfather Abu Jarwal Zuhayr narrated to us, and he was the head of his community. He said:","normalized_form":"Sulayman b. Ahmad al-Lakhmi narrated to me in what he wrote to me. He said: Abu Muhammad `Abdullah b. Rumahis b. Muhammad b. Khalid b. Habib b. Qays b. `Amr b. Ghaziya b. Jashm b. Bakr b. Huwazin narrated to us in Rimada al-Qaysiyin (or Rimada al-Filastin), the exalted Rimada (?). He mentioned that there was a man who was one hundred and twenty years old. He said: Ziyad b. Tariq al-Jashmi narrated to us, and he was ninety years old. He said: My grandfather Abu Jarwal Zuhayr narrated to us, and he was the head of his community. He said:","source_row_id":"87438","tradition":"Imami","position":0,"candidates":[{"scholar_indx":2508,"name":"Sulayman bin Abu Hathama bin Hudhayfa ( سليمان بن أبي حثمة بن غانم ( رضي الله عنه","grade":"Comp.(RA)","death_date_hijri":null,"score":0.72,"features":{"exact_match":false,"blocked_match":true,"tradition_bias":false,"death_date_hijri":null}},{"scholar_indx":11005,"name":"Sulayman ibn Yasar سليمان بن يسار مولى ميمونة بنت الحارث","grade":"Follower(Tabi') [3rd Generation]","death_date_hijri":103,"score":0.72,"features":{"exact_match":false,"blocked_match":true,"tradition_bias":false,"death_date_hijri":103}},{"scholar_indx":40020,"name":"Sulayman Ibn Muhammad","grade":"4th Century AH","death_date_hijri":388,"score":0.72,"features":{"exact_match":false,"blocked_match":true,"tradition_bias":false,"death_date_hijri":388}}],"quarantined":true}
