{"staged_at":1779569210134,"surface_form":"Ahmad b. al-Hasan al-Qattan narrated to us, he said: al-Hasan b. Ali al-Sukkari narrated to us, he said: Muhammad b. Zakariyya al-Basri narrated to us, he said: Ja‘far b. Muhammad b. ‘Umara narrated from his father who said: I asked al-Sadiq Ja‘far b. Muhammad (peace be upon them both): Inform me about the death of Musa b. ‘Imran (peace be upon him). He said: When his appointed time came, and he completed his term and his provisions ceased, the Angel of Death (peace be upon him) came to him and said: Peace be upon you, O Kalimullah.","normalized_form":"Ahmad b. al-Hasan al-Qattan narrated to us, he said: al-Hasan b. Ali al-Sukkari narrated to us, he said: Muhammad b. Zakariyya al-Basri narrated to us, he said: Ja‘far b. Muhammad b. ‘Umara narrated from his father who said: I asked al-Sadiq Ja‘far b. Muhammad (peace be upon them both): Inform me about the death of Musa b. ‘Imran (peace be upon him). He said: When his appointed time came, and he completed his term and his provisions ceased, the Angel of Death (peace be upon him) came to him and said: Peace be upon you, O Kalimullah.","source_row_id":"96948","tradition":"Imami","position":0,"candidates":[{"scholar_indx":3573,"name":"Ahmad bin Hafs (  أحمد بن حفص ( رضي الله عنه","grade":"Comp.(RA)","death_date_hijri":null,"score":0.72,"features":{"exact_match":false,"blocked_match":true,"tradition_bias":false,"death_date_hijri":null}},{"scholar_indx":30007,"name":"Ahmad bin Hanbal أحمد بن حنبل","grade":"3rd Century AH [10th generation] [Hanbali]","death_date_hijri":241,"score":0.72,"features":{"exact_match":false,"blocked_match":true,"tradition_bias":false,"death_date_hijri":241}}],"quarantined":true}
